<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA IN 6TH 1-DAY INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA IN 6TH 1-DAY INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat South Africa by five wickets in the sixth one-day international at Centurion Park on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 284-7 in 50 overs, Australia 287-5 in 49 overs.</p>
<p>Australia took an unbeatable 4-2 lead in the seven-match series.</p>
